 items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold transition-transform duration-300\">\n            ▼\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"sec-5-content\" class=\"accordion-content accordion-closed p-6 space-y-6 bg-slate-950/50\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs\">\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold mb-1\">1. 控制面與數據面分離</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400\">JetBrains Central 僅管理授權與點數，原始碼在端點加密傳送，管理伺服器零儲存。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold mb-1\">2. 100% No-Training 承諾</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400\">JetBrains 及 Anthropic, OpenAI, Google 簽約保證：絕不用於公共模型訓練。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold mb-1\">3. 30 天銷毀與 SOC 2</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400\">暫存數據最長 30 天強制自動銷毀。通過 SOC 2 Type II 與 GDPR 驗證。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-5 text-center text-xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-white font-bold mb-1\">JetBrains 原廠 Trust Center 權威背書 portal：</h4>\n          <a href=\"https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-400 font-bold hover:underline\">\n            https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/ 🔗\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SECTION 6: 在地服務 (修正名稱為 迪凱科技 AHASoft) -->\n    <section id=\"sec-6\" class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-xl\">\n      <div onclick=\"toggleSection('sec-6')\" class=\"p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800/40 flex items-center justify-between transition-colors border-b border-slate-800/60 select-none\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/20 border border-sky-500/30 text-sky-400 font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n            06\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-sky-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">第六段：在地服務 (迪凱科技 AHASoft)</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white\">代購/代支代付痛點 vs. JetBrains Central Console 解法</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium hidden sm:inline-block\">點擊展開說明</span>\n          <div id=\"sec-6-icon\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold transition-transform duration-300\">\n            ▼\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"sec-6-content\" class=\"accordion-content accordion-closed p-6 space-y-6 bg-slate-950/50\">\n        \n        <!-- PART 1: 代購痛點與 Central Console 解法 -->\n        <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-slate-200 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-950 border border-red-800 text-red-400 text-[10px]\">第一部分</span>\n              坊間各大 LLM 散買與代購痛點對比（點擊痛點可直接跳出 Central Console 解法）：\n            </h3>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs\">\n            \n            <!-- Pain Point 1 -->\n            <div onclick=\"togglePainSolution('sol-1')\" class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-sky-500/50 p-4 rounded-xl cursor-pointer transition-all\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-red-400 font-bold mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">✕ 痛點一：必須向客戶索取帳號密碼</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-sky-400 underline\">點擊看解法 ▼</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-2\">代購往往需要客戶提供管理員登入帳密，產生巨大的資安破口與權限風險。</p>\n              \n              <div id=\"sol-1\" class=\"hidden mt-3 p-3 bg-sky-950/40 border border-sky-500/30 rounded-lg text-sky-200 animate-fadeIn\">\n                <strong class=\"text-white block mb-1\">✓ JetBrains Central Console 解法：</strong>\n                迪凱科技 AHASoft 直接針對貴公司 JetBrains Console 開通授權與 Credits 充值，完全無需透露任何帳號密碼！\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Pain Point 2 -->\n            <div onclick=\"togglePainSolution('sol-2')\" class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-sky-500/50 p-4 rounded-xl cursor-pointer transition-all\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-red-400 font-bold mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">✕ 痛點二：最低採購數量限制與鎖定</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-sky-400 underline\">點擊看解法 ▼</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-2\">原廠規定高額起訂量，團隊超用時遭到全盤鎖定，影響專案進度無所適從。</p>\n              \n              <div id=\"sol-2\" class=\"hidden mt-3 p-3 bg-sky-950/40 border border-sky-500/30 rounded-lg text-sky-200 animate-fadeIn\">\n                <strong class=\"text-white block mb-1\">✓ JetBrains Central Console 解法：</strong>\n                零最低數量限制！AI Credits 採彈性充值（10 USD 起算），且 Console 儀表板隨時掌握用量，告別無故鎖定。\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Pain Point 3 -->\n            <div onclick=\"togglePainSolution('sol-3')\" class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-sky-500/50 p-4 rounded-xl cursor-pointer transition-all\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-red-400 font-bold mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">✕ 痛點三：原廠政策朝令夕改與天天出新 AI</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-sky-400 underline\">點擊看解法 ▼</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-2\">市場每天出新 AI，同仁分散要求開請購單；原廠政策缺乏長期遵循標準。</p>\n              \n              <div id=\"sol-3\" class=\"hidden mt-3 p-3 bg-sky-950/40 border border-sky-500/30 rounded-lg text-sky-200 animate-fadeIn\">\n                <strong class=\"text-white block mb-1\">✓ JetBrains Central Console 解法：</strong>\n                單一平台包辦 Claude, GPT, Gemini 與 Mellum，不用今天買這家、明天買那家，一套 Console 管理全公司！\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Pain Point 4 -->\n            <div onclick=\"togglePainSolution('sol-4')\" class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-sky-500/50 p-4 rounded-xl cursor-pointer transition-all\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-red-400 font-bold mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">✕ 痛點四：海外客服求助無門與帳務繁瑣</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-sky-400 underline\">點擊看解法 ▼</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-2\">海外客服一等就是幾週，財務每月處理大量分散外幣信用卡請購。</p>\n              \n              <div id=\"sol-4\" class=\"hidden mt-3 p-3 bg-sky-950/40 border border-sky-500/30 rounded-lg text-sky-200 animate-fadeIn\">\n                <strong class=\"text-white block mb-1\">✓ 迪凱科技 AHASoft 在地服務解法：</strong>\n                迪凱科技 AHASoft 提供台灣在地單一窗口服務與合規台幣發票，輕鬆完成核銷！\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PART 2: 代支代付真實窘境 -->\n        <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-3\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z\"></path></svg>\n            第二部分：在代支代付 (Advance Payment) 上時常遇到的真實窘境與業務心聲\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">\n            我們作為業務員，過去在嘗試幫客戶辦理各大 LLM 供應商（Github Copilot / ChatGPT / Claude / Gemini）代支代付時，深刻體會到無奈：\n          </p>\n          <ul class=\"text-slate-400 space-y-2 pl-4 list-disc\">\n            <li><strong>帳單與匯率浮動劇烈</strong>：外幣簽帳的手續費、浮動匯率與增購充值通路不明確，讓財務與採購相當頭痛。</li>\n            <li><strong>無權限管理與缺乏企業級控管</strong>：代購產品無法提供企業 Central 儀表板，無法進行人員離職權限回收或用量上限預防。</li>\n            <li><strong>非授權經銷的後續無保障</strong>：散買代購本質上只是「代代支付」，缺乏原廠政策定性與在地技術支援。</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"pt-2 text-sky-300 font-semibold border-t border-slate-800/60\">\n            👉 **選擇「迪凱科技 AHASoft」代理的 JetBrains AI 生態**，才能徹底將「代購」轉變為「可控、可信、長期依賴的企業級服務」！\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- CTA Footer Section -->\n  <section class=\"py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\">\n    <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-2xl\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4\">\n        「你可以不接受，但是我建議你試試看！在現今這個年代，試試看往往不吃虧。」\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n        迪凱科技 AHASoft 誠摯邀請貴團隊開啟 <strong>JetBrains AI 30 天免責企業試用</strong>。\n      </p>\n      <button onclick=\"openTrialModal()\" class=\"px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-xl shadow-indigo-600/30 transition-all\">\n        免費申請 30 天 Enterprise 企業試用 ➔\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Enterprise Trial Modal -->\n  <div id=\"trial-modal\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-sm hidden items-center justify-center p-4\">\n    <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full p-6 relative shadow-2xl\">\n      <button onclick=\"closeTrialModal()\" class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-lg\">✕</button>\n\n      <div class=\"text-center mb-6\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n          <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/.user_uploaded/media_1788189965528.png\" alt=\"JetBrains\" class=\"h-6 w-auto\">\n          <span class=\"text-slate-600\">✕</span>\n          <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/.user_uploaded/media_1788189968237.png\" alt=\"AHASoft\" class=\"h-6 w-auto bg-white rounded px-1\">\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg\">申請 JetBrains AI 30 天企業試用</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs mt-1\">請填寫基本資料，迪凱科技 AHASoft 專員將於 24 小時內聯繫您服務。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <form onsubmit=\"submitTrialForm(event)\" class=\"space-y-4 text-xs\">\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1\">公司名稱 *</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" required placeholder=\"例如：某某金控 / 科技公司\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1\">聯絡人姓名 *</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" required placeholder=\"例如：張經理 / IT 處長\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1\">公司 Email *</label>\n          <input type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"name@company.com.tw\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\">\n        </div>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30 transition-all mt-2\">\n          送出申請 (由迪凱科技 AHASoft 專員聯繫)\n        </button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Vanilla JavaScript Control Scripts -->\n  <script>\n    function toggleSection(secId) {\n      const content = document.getElementById(`${secId}-content`);\n      const icon = document.getElementById(`${secId}-icon`);\n      const isClosed = content.classList.contains('accordion-closed');\n\n      if (isClosed) {\n        content.classList.remove('accordion-closed');\n        content.classList.add('accordion-open');\n        icon.textContent = '▲';\n        icon.classList.add('bg-indigo-600', 'text-white');\n      } else {\n        content.classList.remove('accordion-open');\n        content.classList.add('accordion-closed');\n        icon.textContent = '▼';\n        icon.classList.remove('bg-indigo-600', 'text-white');\n      }\n    }\n\n    function navigateToSection(secId) {\n      const section = document.getElementById(secId);\n      const content = document.getElementById(`${secId}-content`);\n      const icon = document.getElementById(`${secId}-icon`);\n\n      if (content.classList.contains('accordion-closed')) {\n        content.classList.remove('accordion-closed');\n        content.classList.add('accordion-open');\n        icon.textContent = '▲';\n        icon.classList.add('bg-indigo-600', 'text-white');\n      }\n\n      section.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });\n    }\n\n    function expandAllSections() {\n      ['sec-1', 'sec-2', 'sec-3', 'sec-4', 'sec-5', 'sec-6'].forEach(secId => {\n        const content = document.getElementById(`${secId}-content`);\n        const icon = document.getElementById(`${secId}-icon`);\n        content.classList.remove('accordion-closed');\n        content.classList.add('accordion-open');\n        icon.textContent = '▲';\n        icon.classList.add('bg-indigo-600', 'text-white');\n      });\n    }\n\n    function collapseAllSections() {\n      ['sec-1', 'sec-2', 'sec-3', 'sec-4', 'sec-5', 'sec-6'].forEach(secId => {\n        const content = document.getElementById(`${secId}-content`);\n        const icon = document.getElementById(`${secId}-icon`);\n        content.classList.remove('accordion-open');\n        content.classList.add('accordion-closed');\n        icon.textContent = '▼';\n        icon.classList.remove('bg-indigo-600', 'text-white');\n      });\n    }\n\n    function togglePainSolution(solId) {\n      const sol = document.getElementById(solId);\n      if (sol.classList.contains('hidden')) {\n        sol.classList.remove('hidden');\n      } else {\n        sol.classList.add('hidden');\n      }\n    }\n\n    function openTrialModal() {\n      document.getElementById('trial-modal').classList.remove('hidden');\n      document.getElementById('trial-modal').classList.add('flex');\n    }\n\n    function closeTrialModal() {\n      document.getElementById('trial-modal').classList.remove('flex');\n      document.getElementById('trial-modal').classList.add('hidden');\n    }\n\n    function submitTrialForm(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      alert('感謝您的申請！迪凱科技 AHASoft 專員已收到您的資訊，將於 24 小時內專人與您聯繫安排 30 天 Enterprise 企業試用環境！');\n      closeTrialModal();\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"更新迪凱科技 Portal 網站：1. 左上角導覽列標誌改為 JetBrains 與 迪凱科技 AHASoft (知之藏) Logo 並列；2. 第一段新增 JetBrains 2026 年度銷售報告預覽卡片與連結；3. 代理商名稱統一修正為「迪凱科技 AHASoft」。","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html","toolAction":"Updating portal HTML with user uploaded logos and 2026 report preview","toolSummary":"Update portal HTML with dual logos, 2026 report, and AHASoft branding"}}]}
